###

Solución
Desde el directorio actual:
cd ~/github/warebox/dependencies/hayabusa
rm -rf rules
git clone https://github.com/Yamato-Security/hayabusa-rules.git rules

Luego verifica:

find rules -maxdepth 2 -type d | sort | head -20


